# Understanding Permission 775

| Number | Meaning                |
| ------ | ---------------------- |
| 7      | Read + Write + Execute |
| 7      | Read + Write + Execute |
| 5      | Read + Execute         |

### Example

```bash
chmod 775 /opt/dev-project
```

Meaning:

* Owner has full access
* Group has full access
* Others can only read and execute

